WEBVTT

00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:08.436
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.435 --> 00:00:11.930
<v><b>M:</b></v> They’re planning to drive to Los Angeles.

00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:14.576
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:17.475
<v><b>F:</b></v> I hope to see you again.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:20.226
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:21.237 --> 00:00:23.077
<v><b>M:</b></v> She wants to know the answer.

00:00:25.082 --> 00:00:25.895
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.904 --> 00:00:29.392
<v><b>F:</b></v> You promised to be here at 8:00.

00:00:31.391 --> 00:00:32.218
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:33.271 --> 00:00:35.382
<v><b>M:</b></v> I forgot to turn off the TV.

00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:38.216
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.209 --> 00:00:41.385
<v><b>F:</b></v> Did you remember to buy some milk?